* `b1-lift` · ~/.lares-scratch/b1-lift/wt · `b1adaa476` (+ Face-Keyer building slice 3-ii) · the browser vessel lift: slices 0 (page-entry witness), 1 (substrate seams), 2 (the vessel runs in `vessel.worker.ts`; the page speaks a typed port), 1b (the clean ceremony document takes every secret over a service-worker-brokered port; operator APPROVED 2026-11-05), the reload drain + witness reds, the mirror keeps a typist's focus, 3-i (per-tab in-memory sessions, own unlock each, last-session lock drops every key, one owner per store, ownerEpoch). Building: 3-ii (per-face FCK map + slot trees, `face` on every ask/clear, K19 providers, sibling sealing, ember row, no-custody-slot, K15/Wave B reds). Then: slice 4 (SharedWorker house + the floor's service-worker port broker for follower tabs, Pronaos routes), 5b (one composeVessel with the node), 6 (idempotence: ownerEpoch, durable txId ledger), 7 (durability reading), the joined node+browser founding gate, the phone walk.
* `b1-seal` · ~/.lares-scratch/b1-seal/wt · `bdcba4f9f` (+ Catalog-Splitter building) · sealed-store step three; the repair; slice 5a (browser capability record, session signer); the sealed rest under the production Repo on node and browser; true writer; stand-down flush; published bag key; the P1 clear-write cure (a dropped dial never writes clear); holder routes; browser lock unmaps; fresh-base crash order; manifest writer field. Building: the catalog and daemon bag split per face (D) + floor-public (F), islands' own stores sealed, charter lookup field, staged CAD shelf sealed, node lift session books edits, crash test, P3s, the restart e2e as a standing test.
* Parked: `spend-burn` (6a63e0991), the spend table — lands with the AI-harness batch once the live wiki stands (operator).
* Held (dirty, patches saved byte-equal at ~/.lares-scratch/controller/builder-tree-patches/): promote/wt-lifecycle50, wt-migrate46, wt-recovery47 — removal is the operator's call.

