# S3b lands. 2. b1-seal and b1-lift finish their slices and merge (b1-seal into b1-lift, then the span). 3. The joined node+browser founding gate. 4. The phone walk (iPhone + Android) with the capability probe. 5. The pre-rite (image rebuilt last at the landed head with its GIT_REV label; old homes renamed aside after `down`; the projection check; no `.lar-test-scratch` under the root) — the runbook draft from the Terra scout. 6. The operator's rite.

<<~/ahu>>

